## Approach
Perform binary search by repeatedly dividing the search interval in half. Compare target with middle element.

## Algorithm
Iterative Binary Search

## Code
```rust
fn binary_search(nums: &[i32], target: i32) -> i32 {
 let mut low = 0i32;
 let mut high = nums.len() as i32 - 1;
 while low <= high {
 let mid = low + (high - low) / 2;
 let val = nums[mid as usize];
 if val == target {
 return mid;
 } else if val < target {
 low = mid + 1;
 } else {
 high = mid - 1;
 }
 }
 -1
}

fn main() {
 let nums = vec![-1, 0, 3, 5, 9, 12];
 println!("{}", binary_search(&nums, 9));
}
```

## Complexity
- Time Complexity: O(log n)
- Space Complexity: O(1)
